  "discussion": "Show all filename extensions _MUST_ be enabled in the Finder.\n\n[NOTE]\n====\nThe check and fix are for the currently logged in user. To get the currently logged in user, run the following.\n[source,bash]\n-  CURRENT_USER=$( /usr/bin/defaults read /Library/Preferences/com.apple.loginwindow lastUserName )\n-  ====\n",
  "discussion_format": "asciidoc",
  "id": "mscp.os_show_filename_extensions_enable",
